# Available Endpoints:
# - GET /api/v1/series?pageSize={size} - List all series (paginated)
# - GET /api/v1/series/{id} - Get series details by ID

# Authentication:
# The app uses Firebase Anonymous Authentication to get Bearer tokens
# Token is automatically attached to all API requests
# Header: Authorization: Bearer {firebase_id_token}

# How it works:
# 1. On app start, Firebase signs in anonymously
# 2. An ID token is obtained from Firebase Auth
# 3. The token is automatically added to all API requests
# 4. Tokens are refreshed automatically by Firebase

